   {
    "frase": "Introduction Pharmaceutically relevant small organic molecules tend to exist in  more than one crystal form.[1] These materials can represent",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "1"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "Fucke,   School of Medicine, Pharmacy and Health, Durham University  University Boulevard, Stockton-on-Tees, TS17 6BH, United  Kingdom  Fax: +44 191 +  E-mail: Katharina.Fucke@durham.ac.uk",
