   {
    "frase": "This form (Table S1 and Figure 5) corresponds to the  anhydrous crystal form described by Folen and co-workers (Form  I).[25] In light of the close correlation of the crystal packing as well  as the lack of interaction b",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "25"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "Since the tetartohydrate and Form I are structurally very  closely related, it is difficult to determine with certainty, which  crystal form was originally described by Folen et al.[25] Even  though sufficiently large qu",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
