    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "The structures of three dimethylsulfoxide (DMSO) solvates,  namely tetra-, di- and monosolvate, have been communicated  previously and show an intriguing series of snapshots of the  desolvation process during the crystal",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
