   },
   {
    "frase": "This tendency could be due to the awkward shape of the  molecule with an asymmetric tripodal arrangement of the  substituents whilst having a generally flat core.[37] And even  though three non-solvated crystal forms exi",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
