   {
    "frase": "[kJ mol-1]  DMF disolvate  O1···O1SA  2.528(5)  169(2)  -53.1a  N1···O3  2.796(5)  159.9(2)  -34.5  N2···O4  2.807(6)  168.1(2)  -28.7  I1∙∙∙O2  3.044(3)    -2.6  I2···O1SC  I2···O1SD",
