   },
   {
    "frase": "This finding consolidates the hypothesis that the  strongest hydrogen-bond donor will interact with the strongest  hydrogen bond-acceptor.[38] It is very likely that during the  nucleation process, this interaction is th",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "38",
     "26"
    ],
    "n": 2
   },
   {
    "frase": "Considering the importance of solvates in finding new  polymorphs,[3a] as recently shown for furosemide,[39] for which the  DMSO solvate desolvates to a different anhydrous crystal form  than the solvates from THF, dioxa",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
